    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJO9kJc7o3yUwRJY-sgS_Z0lY",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mimi the Travel Bee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117542156103217041817/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJufuwpf_TeMGCkA-nEYnaOLVii1vwkfQAGJxD8Nj6h7VDhyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing meal at Usine Grecque! The food was absolutely delicious, with generous portions that left me more than satisfied. Their poutine is a must-try—so flavorful and perfectly made. The ambiance was warm and inviting, making the whole dining experience even better.\n\nEven though our server was new, the service was fantastic—friendly, attentive, and professional. I also really appreciated how kid-friendly the restaurant is, making it a great spot for families. I’ll definitely be returning and highly recommend this place to anyone looking for great Greek food!",
        "time": 1738384398,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We ordered the calamari plate and chicken pita. Everything was fresh and tasty! The calamari was perfectly crispy, and the chicken was tender and generously portioned. The fries in the chicken pita were a delicious touch, and the generous amount of pita cheese in the salad was a pleasant surprise. The entire team works hard to deliver excellent service and maintain top-quality food.",
        "time": 1737929197,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nowfal Mouktani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113268438198414611419/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXjbVRWhSMGgzyHCxSqZfwNOcrTct64WyR7Gnm5zi3l2fbkiYc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Food looks great, but that's about it. I ordered the chicken plate with fries. The fries were undercooked, the chicken was overcooked/tough/dry. The seasoning on the fries was ok, but there seems to be a sweetness that might not be for everyone. The seasoning on the chicken was great though. Tzatziki sauce was great.\n\nEDIT: I was eating the takeout 60 seconds after I got the meal since I work a 400m walk from there and walked while eating all of the fries. This is also a representation of dine in... Unless their dine in gets special treatment.\n\nDisappointed at the portion sizes. For 18ish dollars, you get one chicken skewers and half a pita . And you have to crumble your feta since they just put a slice of it on top of the salad. 3 stars for service because I waited 18 minutes for takeout.\n\nEDIT : I made the review for poutineville since its the same place just with 2 brands. Ghost/not Ghost kitchen style. Different food, same kitchen. One star down for that.",
        "time": 1694838099,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cassandra Fournier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105609022371409481049/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocILMkI79xm_rMozbwFcI42ZbkKiJiD45fLDKbLQvEWuh0YJWw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very impressed. I ordered two chicken sticks and a small Greek salad. The chicken sticks are VERY good. I did not like the feta as it is goat cheese (I thought it was cow cheese) so I called in and they remade my salad but gave me a large instead of a small. Service 20/10, I will definitely be going back. Thank you!",
        "time": 1697221265,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
